          "docs": "The \"Retrieve list of company's information\" API enables to get a list of customers based on multiple criteria such as corporateName, nationalFiscalNumber, address town name, address postal code.\nAll companies whose corporate name includes the 'corporate name' parameter are returned (e.g. 'zon' => 'amazon' + 'zon craft', ...)"
        },
